<http://www.opengis.net/ont/sf#Point> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#Geometry> .
<http://www.opengis.net/ont/sf#Point> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Se representa un tipo de punto de alto nivel. Esta clase es equivalente a GFI_Point definida en ISO 19156 y es superclase de todos los tipos de puntos."@es .
<http://www.opengis.net/ont/sf#Point> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This class represents the top-level point type. This \tclass is equivalent to GFI_Point defined in ISO 19156, and it is superclass of all point types."@en .
<http://www.opengis.net/ont/sf#Point> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#> .
